'''Almocatén''' (from {{Langx|ar|المُقَطَّن| al-muqaṭṭan|the quilted one}}) is a [[Planned communities in Balisca|planned community]] in the [[Juyú]] [[Regions of Balisca|region]] of [[Araucaria]], within the [[Baliscan Confederation]]. The commune was established through the actions of its canton in 1998, and large-scale development began shortly thereafter.   

